# A Trip Begins (Q007), refused: a human of level 3 is turned away by Mirabel (elves only)
# Hand-written from the quest script (no reference trace): the first talk of a character that cannot
# take the quest shows the refusal page and starts nothing.
character Visitor 3
script quest.Q007_ATripBegins
item 7572 7559 7570
page gatekeeper/30146.htm
page script/quest/Q007_ATripBegins/
npc mirabel 30146 Gatekeeper 10 0 0

action mirabel
action mirabel
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=mirabel item=0 page=gatekeeper/30146.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass npc_{mirabel}_Quest
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=mirabel item=0 page=script/quest/Q007_ATripBegins/30146-01.htm
